AltoReferralWhitelistAdapter::setReferralWhitelist
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when setting address to whitelisted true
    │   ├── it should set referral whitelist mapping to true
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    ├── when setting address to whitelisted false
    │   ├── it should set referral whitelist mapping to false
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    ├── when updating whitelist status from false to true
    │   ├── it should update referral whitelist mapping
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    ├── when updating whitelist status from true to false
    │   ├── it should update referral whitelist mapping
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    └── when setting whitelist for multiple addresses
        ├── it should set referral whitelist mapping for each address
        └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event for each address
